{{Splblocknotes
| name = Unstable Concoction
| desc = The self-explosion component, both defensively or offensively, do not interact with [[Spell Block]] sources.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Unstable Concoction
| desc = {{H|Rubick}} instantly self-{{M|stuns}} for the total brew duration upon losing the ability.
}}
{{Morphnotes
| name = Unstable Concoction
| desc = Does not self-{{M|stun}} upon losing the ability or while the brew timer ends when the {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|[[Morphling#Morph|morphling_replicate]]}} expires.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Interrupts Alchemist's {{M|channeling}} abilities upon cast.
** Can self-{{M|deny}} with the self-damage.
** {{Symbol|a|Counter}}
*** A countdown timer appears indicating the current Unstable Concoction brew time. This is visible to everyone.
**** However, enemy heroes can only hear the ability cast sound if Alchemist casts Unstable Concoction within their {{M|vision}} range.
*** When Alchemist {{M|dies}} while brewing, the Unstable Concoction immediately explodes, dealing the {{M|spell damage|x}} within the radius centered around Alchemist based on the brew time.
** {{Symbol|Move Speed}}
*** Grants bonus [[movement speed]] in the following conditions:
**** Until the {{A|Alchemist|Unstable Concoction Throw}} {{M|sub-ability}} is used.
**** The Unstable Concoction explodes on self.

* The ability values change per {{#var:Unstable Concoction basic1}}-seconds brewed, reaching the max values over {{#var:Unstable Concoction value2}} seconds:
** {{Symbol|a|up}}
*** Increases the total {{M|physical}} {{M|spell damage}} by {{calc|v1/{{#var:Unstable Concoction value2}}*{{#var:Unstable Concoction basic1}}|v1={{#var:Unstable Concoction value6}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1/{{#var:Unstable Concoction value2}}*{{#var:Unstable Concoction basic1}}|v1={{#var:Unstable Concoction value6 tal}}}}|20tal}}) per interval.
*** Increases the {{M|stun}} duration by {{calc|(v1-{{#var:Unstable Concoction value7}})/{{#var:Unstable Concoction value2}}*{{#var:Unstable Concoction basic1}}|v1={{#var:Unstable Concoction value8}}}} seconds per interval.
*** The {{A|Alchemist|Corrosive Weaponry}} stacks applied, and is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|StackGain {{=}} [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌈]] BrewTime [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌉]]}} with {{Code|MINStack {{=}} {{#var:Unstable Concoction type1 value2}} , MAXStack {{=}} {{#expr:ceil({{#var:Unstable Concoction value3}})}}}}

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# The {{M|physical}} {{M|spell damage}} within the radius.
*# {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[stun]]ned}}
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Stack}}
*#* Applies {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|alchemist_[[Alchemist#Corrosive Weaponry|corrosive_weaponry]]_debuff}} corresponding to the brew time.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Unstable Concoction icon0}}
| desc = Alchemist brews up an unstable concoction that he can throw at an enemy hero, to stun and deal damage in an area around the explosion. The longer the concoction brews, the more damage it deals and the longer the stun. Alchemist is faster while charging the concoction. After {{#var:Unstable Concoction value2}} seconds, the brew reaches its maximum damage and stun time. However, after {{#var:Unstable Concoction value3}} seconds, the concoction will explode on Alchemist himself if not thrown.
}}

